# Subject: Pin dependency versions for Logstash 8.19
# Origin: DHI-internal (DHI dependency maintenance)
# Description: Pin selected bundled dependencies and allow their newer compiler warnings.
# Base-Tree: git https://github.com/elastic/logstash.git 3ff1bc658a507da7b39d3d88f648fb57b129a6d5
# Regenerate: `git diff -- Gemfile.jruby-3.1.lock.release build.gradle`
# Verify: cmd `dhi def build image/logstash/debian-13/8.19.yaml` expect "Successfully built"
# Forwarded: not-needed (DHI dependency policy)
# Drop-When: never: remove individual hunks when upstream carries equivalent dependency versions and warning handling
#
# Upstream 8.19.24 still locks older versions and treats warnings from the updated dependencies as errors during
# compilation.
